<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Glass up 6 pct on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Glass up 6 pct on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceylon Glass Co Ltd rose six percent, or 1.25 rupees to 22, on turnover of 3,100 shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is the ideal retail scrip,&quot; said a broker specialising in retail trade.</p>
<p>&quot;It is cheap, liquid and has good growth potential,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Ceylon glass is the monopoly supplier of glass bottles and containers in Sri Lanka.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
